#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK provides some tools for converting between OpenQASM representations of quantum programs, and the [QuantumCircuit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) class.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK menyediakan beberapa alat untuk mengonversi antara representasi OpenQASM dari program kuantum dan kelas [QuantumCircuit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

